This product is a port of React Aria Sheet from the adobe/react-spectrum
repository (https://github.com/adobe/react-spectrum), Copyright Adobe,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It includes:
- styles/theme.css and styles/Sheet.css: the unchanged React Aria starter
  styles (starters/docs/src).
- src/ios-scroll-lock.js: derived from
  packages/react-aria/src/overlays/usePreventScroll.ts. Modified: rewritten
  as plain JavaScript.
- src/keyboard.js: derived from the keyboard handling of React Aria Sheet
  and Modal. Modified: rewritten as plain JavaScript.
- src/sheet-overlay.js: the visual-viewport handling is derived from React
  Aria Modal. Modified: rewritten as plain JavaScript.
